WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:06.140
So over the last 48 hours, we've had a stunning
contrast between the man who is currently

00:00:06.140 --> 00:00:11.700
president of the United States and the man
that wants to be president of the United States.

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:14.910
And I'm talking, of course, of Donald Trump
and Joe Biden.

00:00:14.910 --> 00:00:21.090
Donald Trump, as I've already told you, to
some degree, I sat in the White House at one

00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:24.430
point in the basement bunker at another point.

00:00:24.430 --> 00:00:30.660
He went down to Florida to give a speech about
Elon Musk's success with NASA in launching

00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:36.399
the Falcon nine rocket with the Dragon spacecraft
to bring two astronauts to the space station.

00:00:36.399 --> 00:00:42.579
And Donald Trump essentially spent the weekend
tweeting, attacking the motives of protesters

00:00:42.579 --> 00:00:49.030
threatening to release vicious dogs against
protesters and generally escalating tensions.

00:00:49.030 --> 00:00:56.370
Meanwhile, Joe Biden, who is four years Trump's
senior, went out and wearing a mask, talk

00:00:56.370 --> 00:01:03.059
to actual protesters about what's going on,
why they are protesting and all of these relevant

00:01:03.059 --> 00:01:10.940
issues in society today took pictures with
people while tweeting, conciliatory and understanding

00:01:10.940 --> 00:01:17.000
things rather than threatening people with
releasing the hounds, essentially.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:20.360
The contrast could not be more stark at this
point.

00:01:20.360 --> 00:01:25.200
No national address from Trump meant to reduce
tensions and bring people together instead.

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:29.220
A weekend of tweets about vicious dogs and
ominous weapons.

00:01:29.220 --> 00:01:33.640
And the Secret Service is going to go after
people tweets talking about we're going to

00:01:33.640 --> 00:01:36.280
make T for a terrorist organization.

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:43.270
And then Trump being rushed on Friday to the
underground bunker used to protect presidents

00:01:43.270 --> 00:01:44.820
during terrorist attacks.

00:01:44.820 --> 00:01:48.770
Below the White House, even China goading
Trump.

00:01:48.770 --> 00:01:55.230
Foreign Ministry spokesman Lesin Zhao urged
the United States to eliminate racial discrimination

00:01:55.230 --> 00:01:58.390
and protect the lawful rights of minorities.

00:01:58.390 --> 00:01:59.600
Who is Eugene?

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:06.030
Editor of the nationalist tabloid The Global
Times telling Donald Trump, Mr. President,

00:02:06.030 --> 00:02:08.710
don't go hide behind the Secret Service.

00:02:08.710 --> 00:02:10.479
Now, that's Trump.

00:02:10.479 --> 00:02:11.500
Then you have Biden.

00:02:11.500 --> 00:02:13.230
Biden, who you don't have to like.

00:02:13.230 --> 00:02:15.920
You don't have to see is a progressive because
he's not.

00:02:15.920 --> 00:02:21.860
Joe Biden went and met with protesters, tweeted
conciliatory messages.

00:02:21.860 --> 00:02:26.970
You don't have to love Biden to understand
the difference between these two men.

00:02:26.970 --> 00:02:31.840
You don't have to see Biden as a progressive
because, as I said, he's not to realize that

00:02:31.840 --> 00:02:37.060
the world is laughing at us and we would be
better off if they stopped.

00:02:37.060 --> 00:02:42.270
And replacing Donald Trump with Biden is the
option we have five months from now.

00:02:42.270 --> 00:02:46.710
And I will be doing everything I can to make
sure that that replacement takes place.

00:02:46.710 --> 00:02:50.860
Trump tweeting about releasing the hounds
on protesters.

00:02:50.860 --> 00:02:56.750
Joe Biden tweeting, quote, We are a nation
in pain right now, but we must not allow this

00:02:56.750 --> 00:02:59.060
pain to destroy us.

00:02:59.060 --> 00:03:01.520
As president, I will help lead this conversation.

00:03:01.520 --> 00:03:06.560
And more importantly, I will listen, just
as I did today, visiting the site of last

00:03:06.560 --> 00:03:09.040
night's protest in Wilmington.

00:03:09.040 --> 00:03:15.700
Biden put publishing a five minute video discussing
what we are seeing with police and George

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:20.390
Floyd in some detail, adding, quote, We are
a country with an open wound.

00:03:20.390 --> 00:03:22.250
None of us can turn away.

00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:23.810
None of us can be silent.

00:03:23.810 --> 00:03:26.050
None of us any longer can hear those words.

00:03:26.050 --> 00:03:28.620
I can't breathe and do nothing.

00:03:28.620 --> 00:03:33.570
We must commit as a nation to pursue justice
with every ounce of our being.

00:03:33.570 --> 00:03:38.930
And most importantly, maybe Joe Biden not
hanging out and about in a bunker or in his

00:03:38.930 --> 00:03:42.920
basement in Delaware, but just going out and
talking to protesters.

00:03:42.920 --> 00:03:44.740
Were showing some of that video now.

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:45.740
So listen.

00:03:45.740 --> 00:03:49.280
Am I saying Joe Biden is the be all end all
on criminal justice reform?

00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:50.280
Of course not.

00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:55.620
Joe Biden sponsored the 1994 crime bill that
was so destructive.

00:03:55.620 --> 00:03:58.230
Bernie Sanders also voted for it, by the way.

00:03:58.230 --> 00:04:03.980
And there is no doubt that not enough was
done during Barack Obama's administration,

00:04:03.980 --> 00:04:06.490
of which Biden was apart on criminal justice.

00:04:06.490 --> 00:04:08.900
But this is comparing apples to bicycle's.

00:04:08.900 --> 00:04:15.350
It's comparing apples to trash when it comes
to Biden and Trump and the leadership deficit

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:17.459
that we're experiencing right now.

00:04:17.459 --> 00:04:18.519
It's a tragedy.

00:04:18.519 --> 00:04:23.780
And the optics of Trump tweeting from a White
House bunker while Joe Biden is kneeling with

00:04:23.780 --> 00:04:24.780
protesters.

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:26.000
This isn't good for Trump.

00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:27.381
It shouldn't be good for Trump.

00:04:27.381 --> 00:04:31.060
And Biden, of course, would not get everything
right as president.

00:04:31.060 --> 00:04:36.810
But at least he would bring back something
that looks and feels like leadership and like

00:04:36.810 --> 00:04:42.120
a man connected to what's happening in the
country, rather than a guy who will literally

00:04:42.120 --> 00:04:45.320
sit in his basement tweeting agit trash.

00:04:45.320 --> 00:05:12.530
As more and more violence is instigated by
virtue

00:05:12.530 --> 00:06:03.979
of his every tweet,

